t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek正式发布V4大模型，支持百万上下文且定价低至1元起</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 协作智能体并开启预览</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 DeepMind 推出解耦式 DiLoCo 架构，通过异步训练提升硬件故障容忍度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/216c63f43c702d3c66ec5d571818a6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 DeepMind 近日推出解耦式 DiLoCo 分布式训练架构，旨在提升大规模 AI 模型训练的效率与鲁棒性。该架构将训练任务分散至多个异步、故障隔离的“学习单元”，各单元在本地完成多次梯度计算后，再将压缩后的梯度信息汇总至外部优化器。相比传统需紧密同步的训练方式，DiLoCo 显著降低了对硬件稳定性的依赖。实验显示，在高硬件故障率环境下，DiLoCo 仍能维持 88% 的利用率，远高于标准数据并行训练的 27%。此外，该架构将跨数据中心带宽需求从 198 Gbps 降至 0.84 Gbps，大幅降低了全球分布式训练的门槛。DiLoCo 具备自愈能力，支持在学习单元失效后继续训练并在恢复后无缝整合。同时，该系统支持异构硬件混合使用，允许不同代次的 TPU 芯片协同工作，有效延长了旧设备使用寿命并缓解了硬件</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宝马联合阿里云发布三款AI智能助手并首发搭载于新世代BMW iX3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/76f64809260842a083fda7d31ed152e5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026北京车展上，宝马联合阿里云发布三款专为中国市场设计的AI智能助手，包括“用车专家”、“出行伙伴”及“百科达人”，新世代BMW iX3长轴距版成为首款搭载车型。其中，“出行伙伴”基于千问大模型与高德地图的深度整合，能理解用户复杂出行需求并即时生成包含充电、餐饮及路线规划的个性化方案；“用车专家”则内置20万条专业用车知识，提供真人顾问级的技术支持。此次发布标志着宝马车机系统从被动响应向主动决策转型。宝马通过将LLM技术与地理空间信息结合，显著提升了智能座舱的交互深度与服务效率，为用户提供更精准的出行决策辅助，进一步强化了其在中国市场的智能化布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek正式发布V4大模型，支持百万上下文且定价低至1元起</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek于4月24日正式推出新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，该模型在数学、STEM及竞赛代码评测中超越现有开源模型，性能直逼顶级闭源模型。DeepSeek-V4支持100万tokens超长上下文，并提供Flash与Pro双版本：Flash版侧重轻量高效，Pro版则在Agent能力与世界知识储备上表现卓越，仅次于Gemini-Pro-3.1。在定价策略上，DeepSeek-V4延续极致性价比，Flash版输入/输出价格分别为1元/2元（每百万tokens），Pro版则为12元/24元。此次发布不仅刷新了开源模型在Agentic Coding等专业评测中的高度，更通过极低的定价门槛，显著降低了开发者与中小企业使用顶级AI能力的成本，推动复杂长文档分析及多轮Agent任务的落地应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ed9417a97357bf4ad41be85508f85d78.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，该模型专为检测并脱敏文本中的个人身份信息（PII）而设计。Privacy Filter基于gpt-oss架构改造为双向token分类器，总参数规模为15亿，活跃参数为5000万，并支持12.8万token的超长上下文处理。该模型具备极高的本地化部署能力，允许用户在浏览器或笔记本电脑本地直接运行，无需将敏感数据上传至云端，有效保障数据隐私安全。在PII-Masking-300k基准测试中，该模型表现优异，F1分数达到96%，修正后更提升至97.43%。此次开源为开发者提供了高效的本地化PII防护方案，降低了处理敏感文本时的合规风险，对需要处理大规模隐私数据的行业应用具有重要参考价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 协作智能体并开启预览</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e189c960baf28424a890510b7398c525.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 23 日正式发布 Workspace Agents，旨在支持团队创建可处理复杂任务与长周期工作流的协作智能体。该功能由 Codex 提供底层技术支持，具备文件处理、代码运行、工具调用及记忆存储能力，支持全天候云端运行。Workspace Agents 能够实现定时调度并与 Slack 集成，通过将隐性知识转化为显性工作流，协助团队完成软件审查、指标报告及自动工单提交等任务。目前，该功能已面向 ChatGPT Business、Enterprise、Edu 及 Teachers 计划用户开放研究预览，用户可在 2026 年 5 月 6 日前免费使用，此后将转为积分计费模式。OpenAI 内部已部署多种应用实例，验证了其在自动化办公与知识沉淀方面的效能。未来，OpenAI 计划引入自动触发</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
